Description: Windows 95-style Wayland desktop
 A complete desktop session in the style of Windows 95: a Wayland
 compositor with the taskbar, Start menu and window frames, plus its own
 File Manager, Notepad, Terminal, Control Panel, System Monitor and file
 dialogs for other programs. Log in to it as "Wayland 95".
